# Jewelry Hub - FYP Technical Rules & Context

## Project Overview
- A high-end Jewelry Management System for a family business (UK University Final Year Project).
- Roles: Admin (Web Dashboard), Artisan (Mobile), Customer (Mobile).

## Tech Stack
- Backend: Laravel (REST API & Admin Web Panel).
- Frontend: Flutter (Multi-role Mobile App).
- Real-time: Firebase (Chat & Order Progress Tracking).
- Database: MySQL.

## Business Logic & Unit Standards
- Base Currency: **MMK** — stored monetary amounts (catalog labor/gems, gold snapshots, quote/order lines, totals) are in Myanmar Kyat.
- FX Snapshot: `mmk_per_usd` (MMK per 1 USD) for deriving USD display and frozen `*_usd_snapshot` fields on quotes/orders.
- Display Currencies: MMK (primary in app) and USD (derived); optional GBP later via conversion.
- Weight Unit: Base unit is Grams.
- Local Display: Support Myanmar units (16.606g = 1 Kyat, 16 Pae = 1 Kyat, 8 Yway = 1 Pae).
- Pricing: Total MMK = (Weight × Live Gold MMK/gram) + Labor (MMK) + Gems (MMK).
- Catalog **list prices** require **active** gold + FX snapshots (`GET /api/v1/catalog/products` → `meta.pricing_configured`). After `php artisan db:seed`, **`PricingSnapshotSeeder`** (before **`CatalogSeeder`**) supplies demo snapshots so the mobile **`PriceTag`** is numeric, not “Price on request”.

## Development Rules
- Database First: Always define migrations before implementing features.
- Documentation: Every major implementation must be logged in `docs/FYP_Technical_Log.md`.
- Localization: Use a conversion service/provider for all currency and weight displays.
- Real-time: Use Firebase Streams for Chat and Progress Updates in Flutter.

## Global UI Standard (Flutter)
- **Theme**: Premium **Dark Gold** — primary `#D4AF37`, background `#0F172A`, elevated surfaces slate (`#1E293B` / `#334155`).
- **Glassmorphism**: Use shared glass cards — `BackdropFilter` blur, thin semi-transparent **gold** border, layered gradient fills (no flat gray slabs for primary surfaces).
- **Typography**: Distinctive pairing — display/brand via **Cinzel Decorative** (or equivalent), body/UI via **Outfit**; hierarchy: display > headline > body > caption (see `frontend/lib/core/ui/design_system.dart`).
- **Motion**: Prefer short fades (`AnimatedSwitcher` / `FadeTransition`) when switching **currency** or **weight units**; avoid jarring snaps.
- **Mandatory reuse**: New Flutter screens **must** use `frontend/lib/core/ui/design_system.dart` (`AppColors`, `AppTheme`, `AppGradients`, radii) and widgets under `frontend/lib/core/ui/widgets/` (`AppGlassCard`, `AppGoldButton`, `PremiumText`, `PriceTag`, `WeightBadge`) unless a one-off is explicitly justified in the task.
- **Auth (Flutter)**: Sanctum **bearer token** in **`flutter_secure_storage`** (`AuthTokenStorage`); session state in **`AuthProvider`** (`frontend/lib/core/providers/auth_provider.dart`). API calls live under **`frontend/lib/features/auth/data/auth_api.dart`**. The app **gates** the home stack: signed-out users see **login/register**; after sign-in, **customer catalog** is the default shell (admin/artisan can still sign in for testing; role-specific mobile homes can branch later). Use **`AuthProvider.token`** for new authenticated `http` clients.
- **Inquiries & chat**: Customer **`features/inquiries/`** + **`CustomerShell`** (catalog + inquiries tabs). Firestore path **`inquiry_threads/{firebase_thread_id}/messages`**; Laravel **`POST /api/v1/conversations/{inquiry}/firebase-token`** mints the custom token. Filament **`InquiryResource`** + **`ChatInquiry`** page for admin. Configure Firebase per **`docs/Firebase_Setup.md`** and deploy **`firebase/firestore.rules`**.
- **Backend admin (web)**: Filament panel at `/admin`; primary color aligned to `#D4AF37` for consistency with the app. **Pricing** sidebar: **Gold prices** + **Exchange rates** (create new snapshots via `PricingService`; history is read-only in the UI).

## Architecture
- Root Directory:
  /backend (Laravel)
  /frontend (Flutter)
  /docs (Documentation)